To incorporate a highly efficient architecture into our ensemble, we selected MobileNetV264. This model was specifically designed for mobile and embedded vision applications, offering an excellent trade-off between computational efficiency and accuracy. Its core innovation is the inverted residual with a linear bottleneck structure. Unlike traditional residual blocks that first compress and then expand feature maps, MobileNetV2’s inverted residual block first expands the channel dimension using a lightweight \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
